*HEADING
Project 05 V3c: uniform temperature rise 20 -> 22 degC, frame support = distributed membrane restraint (equations) + uz on the mid-plane lines, linear
** SI units (m, kg, s, N, Pa), temperatures in degC
*INCLUDE, INPUT=../../mesh/v_n40_z2.inp
*INCLUDE, INPUT=../../mesh/v_n40_z2_frame.inp
*NSET, NSET=FRAME_ALL
FRAME_X0, FRAME_X1, FRAME_Y0, FRAME_Y1
*MATERIAL, NAME=TI64
*ELASTIC
113.8E9, 0.33
*EXPANSION, ZERO=20.
8.6E-6
*SOLID SECTION, ELSET=PANEL, MATERIAL=TI64
*INITIAL CONDITIONS, TYPE=TEMPERATURE
NALL, 20.
** in-plane restraint comes from the equations; out-of-plane support on the four mid-thickness edge lines
*BOUNDARY
FRAME_ALL, 3, 3
*STEP
*STATIC
1., 1., 1.E-5, 1.
*TEMPERATURE
NALL, 22.
*NODE PRINT, NSET=COL_CEN
U
*EL PRINT, ELSET=PANEL
S
*NODE PRINT, NSET=FACE_X0, TOTALS=ONLY
RF
*NODE PRINT, NSET=FACE_X1, TOTALS=ONLY
RF
*NODE PRINT, NSET=FACE_Y0, TOTALS=ONLY
RF
*NODE PRINT, NSET=FACE_Y1, TOTALS=ONLY
RF
